{"files": [{"id": 64381794, "name": "umaneb_data.zip", "size": 104370519, "is_link_only": false, "download_url": "https://ndownloader.figshare.com/files/64381794", "supplied_md5": "e8645198263ca822ba280dc1fd215ec1", "computed_md5": "e8645198263ca822ba280dc1fd215ec1", "mimetype": "application/zip"}, {"id": 64452588, "name": "UMA_NEB_energy.csv", "size": 818592, "is_link_only": false, "download_url": "https://ndownloader.figshare.com/files/64452588", "supplied_md5": "7872731c57370a28cf158dac50fc9966", "computed_md5": "7872731c57370a28cf158dac50fc9966", "mimetype": "text/csv"}], "folder_structure": {}, "authors": [{"id": 23858004, "full_name": "Ramanuja Srinivasan Saravanan", "first_name": "Ramanuja Srinivasan", "last_name": "Saravanan", "is_active": true, "url_name": "Ramanuja_Srinivasan_Saravanan", "orcid_id": "0000-0003-3710-8034"}, {"id": 3717493, "full_name": "Yifei Mo", "first_name": "Yifei", "last_name": "Mo", "is_active": true, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}], "custom_fields": [], "figshare_url": "https://figshare.com/articles/dataset/UMA-NEB_Structures_and_Energies_for_Ion_Migration_in_Solid-State_Ionic_Conductors/32221506", "download_disabled": false, "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\">This dataset contains structures and energies from climbing-image nudged elastic band (CI-NEB) calculations performed using the Universal Models for Atoms (UMA) machine learning interatomic potential (MLIP). It covers ion migration pathways for Li\u207a, Na\u207a, K\u207a, and Mg\u00b2\u207a conductors spanning oxide, sulfide, and halide chemistries.</p><p dir=\"ltr\">The dataset comprises 3,195 migration pathways derived from 383 host structures. For each pathway, the NEB images (CONTCAR structures) and their corresponding energies are provided, enabling the computation of migration energy barriers (E\u2098) and kinetically resolved activation (KRA) barriers.</p>", "funding": "Collaborative Research: DMREF: Accelerated Data-Driven Discovery of Ion-Conducting Materials", "funding